URL: [gianfrancodemarco.dev](https://gianfrancodemarco.dev)

### Start in development


Fetch the theme:
```bash
git submodule update --init --recursive
```

Start the server:
```bash
hugo server -DF
```

Internal links are root-relative (`/posts/`, etc.), so any `hugo server` port works.


### Deploy

Push a new version to the main branch to start a new deploy